OL,3,GNEWSADissidents may have mounted gun
OL,4,Aattacks on Garvaghy Road, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FDissident republicans may have mounted
OL,7,Fgun attacks on police had officers
OL,8,Fcleared a path for an Orange parade on
OL,9,Fthe Garvaghy Road, the High Court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe court has begun hearing a legal
OL,13,Fchallenge against the secretary of
OL,14,Fstate's decision to ban the Drumcree
OL,15,Fparade on security advice.
OL,17,FA lawyer for the Orange Order member
OL,18,Fbringing the case told the court about
OL,19,Fthe contents of Police Service of
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) intelligence
OL,21,Fmaterial.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
